      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "Astra: These drafts repeat a checking plan; no retrieved source or experimental result is visible here. Set the checklist aside, leaving the claim unresolved. Consider only your proposed full-data versus reduced-data comparison: if the performance scores were similar, what would that establish about LoRA specifically? Which assumption in that inference deserves closer attention? Treat the outcome as hypothetical, not as completed work."
